<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <actionCalls>
        <name>Send_Notificacao</name>
        <label>Enviar notificacao in-app ao N1</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>528</locationY>
        <actionName>customNotificationAction</actionName>
        <actionType>customNotificationAction</actionType>
        <flowTransactionModel>CurrentTransaction</flowTransactionModel>
        <inputParameters>
            <name>customNotifTypeId</name>
            <value>
                <elementReference>Get_CNT.Id</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputParameters>
        <inputParameters>
            <name>title</name>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Proposta para aprovar</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputParameters>
        <inputParameters>
            <name>body</name>
            <value>
                <elementReference>formulaBody</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputParameters>
        <inputParameters>
            <name>recipientIds</name>
            <value>
                <elementReference>varRecipientIds</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputParameters>
        <inputParameters>
            <name>targetId</name>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.Id</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputParameters>
        <nameSegment>customNotificationAction</nameSegment>
    </actionCalls>
    <apiVersion>66.0</apiVersion>
    <areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>false</areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>
    <assignments>
        <name>Add_Recipient</name>
        <label>Adicionar N1 aos destinatarios</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>408</locationY>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>varRecipientIds</assignToReference>
            <operator>Add</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.Aprovador_Alvo_N1__c</elementReference>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Send_Notificacao</targetReference>
        </connector>
    </assignments>
    <description>ADITIVO e independente dos thresholds. Notificacao in-app (sino + push movel) do 1o nivel de aprovacao: quando Approval_Status__c muda para &quot;Aguarda L1&quot;, avisa o aprovador N1 resolvido pela matriz (Aprovador_Alvo_N1__c), com nome e valor da oportunidade e link para o registo. O destinatario e&apos; o aprovador resolvido pela matriz, como no L2 e no L3, e nao a hierarquia do dono. O gatilho e&apos; o estado de aprovacao e nao a mudanca de fase, porque e&apos; o instante em que o work item nasce na fila do N1 (initialSubmissionAction SC_AP_Set_Aguarda_L1) e ja&apos; depois de o motor decidir se ha aprovacao. Guarda no start: so&apos; dispara com o alvo preenchido. Id do Custom Notification Type por DeveloperName (Aprovacao_Pendente), sem hardcode. Nao toca em CMT, email nem thresholds.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>formulaBody</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>{!$Record.Name} &amp; &quot; — &quot; &amp; TEXT({!$Record.Amount}) &amp; &quot; EUR&quot;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>SC Notif Aprovacao InApp {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>SC - Notif Aprovacao InApp</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>Get_CNT</name>
        <label>Get Custom Notification Type</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>288</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Add_Recipient</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>DeveloperName</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Aprovacao_Pendente</stringValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>CustomNotificationType</object>
        <queriedFields>Id</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>DeveloperName</queriedFields>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <start>
        <locationX>50</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Get_CNT</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>true</doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>
        <filterFormula>ISPICKVAL({!$Record.Approval_Status__c}, &quot;Aguarda L1&quot;) &amp;&amp; NOT(ISBLANK({!$Record.Aprovador_Alvo_N1__c}))</filterFormula>
        <object>Opportunity</object>
        <recordTriggerType>Update</recordTriggerType>
        <triggerType>RecordAfterSave</triggerType>
    </start>
    <status>Active</status>
    <variables>
        <name>varRecipientIds</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <isCollection>true</isCollection>
        <isInput>false</isInput>
        <isOutput>false</isOutput>
    </variables>
</Flow>
